#: ../src/spacecmd/system.py:4757
msgid ""
"system_schedulespmigration: Schedule a Service Pack migration for systems."
msgstr "system_schedulespmigration: ກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງການຍ້າຍ Service Pack ສຳລັບລະບົບ."

#: ../src/spacecmd/system.py:4761
msgid ""
"usage: system_schedulespmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> "
"<MIGRATION_TARGET> [options] \n"
"    For MIGRATION_TARGET parameter see system_listmigrationtargets. \n"
"    The MIGRATION_TARGET parameter must be passed in the following format: "
"[3143,3146,3147,3145,3144,3148,3062]. \n"
"    Options: \n"
"        -s START_TIME \n"
"        -d pass this flag, if you want to do a dry run \n"
"        -c CHILD_CHANNELS (comma-separated child channels labels (with no "
"spaces))"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີໃຊ້: system_schedulespmigration <ລະບົບ> <ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ> <ປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍ> [ຕົວເລືອກ] \n"
"    ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍຈາກ system_listmigrationtargets. \n"
"    ພາຣາມິເຕີ MIGRATION_TARGET ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ: [3143,3146,3147,3145,3144,3148,3062]. \n"
"    ຕົວເລືອກ: \n"
"        -s START_TIME \n"
"        -d ໃຊ້ແຟລັກນີ້ຖ້າຕ້ອງການທົດລອງລັນ (Dry run) \n"
"        -c CHILD_CHANNELS (ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ)"

#: ../src/spacecmd/system.py:4792
msgid ""
"system_scheduleproductmigration: Schedule a Product migration for systems."
msgstr "system_scheduleproductmigration: ກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product migration) ສຳລັບລະບົບ."

#: ../src/spacecmd/system.py:4796
msgid ""
"usage: system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> "
"<MIGRATION_TARGET> [options] \n"
"    For MIGRATION_TARGET parameter see system_listmigrationtargets. \n"
"    The MIGRATION_TARGET parameter must be passed in the following format: "
"[3143,3146,3147,3145,3144,3148,3062]. \n"
"    Options: \n"
"        -s START_TIME \n"
"        -d pass this flag, if you want to do a dry run \n"
"        --allow-vendor-change pass this flag if you want to allow vendor "
"change \n"
"        -r pass this flag if you want to remove remove products which have "
"no successors \n"
"        -c CHILD_CHANNELS (comma-separated child channels labels (with no "
"spaces))"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີໃຊ້: system_scheduleproductmigration <ລະບົບ> <ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ> <ປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍ> [ຕົວເລືອກ] \n"
"    ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍຈາກ system_listmigrationtargets. \n"
"    ພາຣາມິເຕີ MIGRATION_TARGET ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ: [3143,3146,3147,3145,3144,3148,3062]. \n"
"    ຕົວເລືອກ: \n"
"        -s START_TIME \n"
"        -d ໃຊ້ແຟລັກນີ້ຖ້າຕ້ອງການທົດລອງລັນ (Dry run) \n"
"        --allow-vendor-change ໃຊ້ແຟລັກນີ້ຖ້າອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຜູ້ຜະລິດ (Vendor) \n"
"        -r ໃຊ້ແຟລັກນີ້ຖ້າຕ້ອງການລົບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເວີຊັນໃໝ່ມາແທນ \n"
"        -c CHILD_CHANNELS (ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ)"

